 *   - Batch loss is summed locally across the epoch and Allreduced ONCE per
 *     epoch, not per batch.
 *   - MPI_Barrier surrounds the epoch timer; per-rank epoch time is reduced
 *     with MPI_MAX so reported time reflects the slowest rank.
